    "expectedRule": "Legacy Auction Court tracks four lot dais (force_lot_dais 力, guard_lot_dais 守, art_lot_dais 术, return_lot_dais 归返). Clearing a lot dais grants 1 legacy_scrip and opens a pending lot choice that blocks departure (遗产拍品尚未裁定，请先选择竞得、焚毁或放弃。) until the player resolves law/resolve-auction-lot; bid costs max(1, 1 + priorBidCount - discounted) legacy_scrip where discounted is 1 only when the pending lot's entry passive (legacyGavel 力, anonymousVeil 守, escrowPlate 术, finalLotBell 归返) is equipped, burn costs 1, fold costs 0. The estate_gate start reward grants 2 legacy_scrip; scrip is run-only lootBag legacy_scrip. Resolve logs 遗产拍品·竞得：消耗遗产筹码 N，本轮剩余 M。 / 遗产拍品·焚毁：… / 遗产拍品·放弃：消耗遗产筹码 0，本轮剩余 M。; resolving without a pending choice is rejected 当前没有待裁定的遗产拍品。, an unaffordable bid is rejected 竞价需要 N 枚遗产筹码，当前仅有 M 枚。, and re-selecting a cleared dais is rejected already-resolved. Route gates: the auction_lot_bid claim-vault gates (auction_force_gallery_vault, auction_guard_gallery_vault, auction_art_gallery_vault, auction_return_gallery_vault) open only when the matching lot was bid; burn or fold closes the claim vault permanently with block reason 对应遗产拍品必须竞得；焚毁或放弃后该认领区永久关闭。 and removes the edge from legal adjacent targets so run/move through it is rejected illegal-move. The four auction_all_lots_resolved boss approaches (auction_testimony_boss_gate, auction_rostrum_boss_gate, auction_gallery_boss_gate, auction_archive_boss_gate) need all four lots resolved (力、守、术与归返四件遗产拍品全部裁定后开放。). Starting the estate_auctioneer boss combat with all four lots resolved snapshots the resolved lot choices into bossLotSnapshot and freezes further changes (首领拍品已经冻结，不能再改写归属。); the display appends 首领拍品已冻结. Boss modifiers derive only from the snapshot during boss encounters: bid force grants the player +8% / +14% outgoing force damage (sealed / awakened), bid art +8% / +14% outgoing art damage, bid guard +10% / +16% guardEffect, bid return +10% / +16% healing; fold force grants the boss +5% / +10% allStats, fold art +10% / +18% artPower, fold guard +10% / +18% defense, fold return -10% / -18% healing to the player. Healing pill heals 36 base scaled by healingPercent (30 at -10% sealed with this loadout). Display severity is danger while a lot is pending, warning with unresolved dais, resolved when all four are resolved or the boss snapshot is frozen; the display line is 遗产筹码 N，抉择 X/4，竞得 B，焚毁 U，放弃 F[，待裁定 力之遗产][，首领拍品已冻结]. The law display's auction.availableScrip intentionally reports 0 because the display projection only passes healing pills (identical in the Web v1 oracle); the scrip-correct API is core.getCurrentAuctionLotStatus. Law state and lootBag persist through a save-codec round-trip. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
